  "id": 1114,
  "description": "## Calmshore\nCalmshore is a casual, non-competitive guild with no strict contribution requirements.\n\nWe accept players who enjoy relaxed incremental gameplay and want access to basic guild activities and mechanics (raid, challenge, repair maintenance, energizing Pools bonus) without pressure.  \n\nWe expect members to participate or contribute at their own pace — every little bit helps.\n\nJoining Requirement: Combat Lv. 50\n\nDue to prolonged non-participation from past members, members are now required to participate in any guild activity at least once every 3 weeks.\n\nKick: After 4 days of profile inactivity or 3 weeks of guild inactivity.\nYou will be sent a final notice before being kicked.\n\nRaid: 2x Daily - Discord has role ping.  \nSkybound Eden (Combat Lv. 70) (55 Minutes) - Floating Gardens of Aetheria\n\n1st Raid: PST 6pm, CST 8pm, EST 9pm, UTC 1am, AWST 9am  \n2nd Raid: PST 7am, CST 9am, EST 10am, UTC 2pm, AWST 10pm\n\nEnergizing Pools activated on SAT &amp; SUN (America) / SUN &amp; MON (Eurasia) after 1st raid.  \n(SAT/SUN) PST 6:55pm, CST 8:55pm, EST 9:55pm, (SUN/MON) UTC 1:55am, AWST 9:55am  \n\nOur Discord: https://discord.gg/Np2jQR4BCz\n\nCurrent Goal:  \nComplete Guild Challenges to afford weekly Guild Raids &amp; Energizing Pools  \nMaintain Repair Material in Stockpile\n\n[HISTORY]  \n20251212 Guild Established, transferred from &#039;Harem Kings&#039; Guild  \n20260207 Guild Lv. 60  \n20260323 Guild Lv. 70  \n20260403 Built Energizing Pools  \n20260608 Guild Lv. 80  \n20260803 Guild Lv. 85  \n\n### | GUILD BOARD |\n\n[GUILD MARKS]  \nEach completed Guild Challenge add 1 mark. A raid cost 3 marks &amp; Energizing Pools  cost 5 marks per activation.\n\n[CONTRIBUTION]  \nContribute at your own pace.  \n- Join a raid. (Lv. 70 raid rewards 2.1k gold, 23k Combat EXP, 25k Guild Mastery EXP)\n- Contribute to Guild Challenge. We appreciate all the help we can get.\n- Deposit to Stockpile to repair guild components as soon as possible to save cost.\n\n[REPAIR &amp; STOCKPILE]\nGuild components are best repair at near 80%\n\nMission Table (Stockpile quantity on 17 Aug 26)  \n754 Oak Log (10681)  \n754 Birch Log (31480)  \n754 Banyan Log (31122)  \n1,006 Willow Log (12244)  \n754 Mahogany Log (18374)  \n754 Lead Bar (3635)  \n754 Steel Bar (3536)  \nRepair Stock: 4x\n\nEnergizing Pools  \n2,500 Spruce Log (7655)  \n2,500 Maple Log (36486)  \n1,500 Mystical Log (16784)  \n1,500 Iron Bar (8089)  \n1,500 Mercury Bar (3635)  \n1,500 Uranium Bar (12600)  \nRepair Stock: 3x\n\nBoth Mission Table and Energizing Pools is repairing. Repair &amp; Stockpile list updated, we are good for 2+ months. Thanks you very much for depositing a lot this week!\n\n### | Posted on 20260822 |\n\nPreviously, the guild has been waiting for a few members who wanted to stay at Lv 70 raid. Now, we are ready to move forwards to Lv. 80 raid. \n\nCurrently there are no members between Lv. 70-79, except for drtorao who is inactive.\n\nPlease let me know if any of you wanted to stay at Lv 70 Raid, Floating Garden of Aetheria. Otherwise, we will move on to Lv. 80 raid at Celestial Observatory.\n\n### | Posted on 20260824 |\n\nEnergizing Pools is currently activated, expire in 3 hours. Please visit the guild to &quot;ENTER&quot; the pool to gain its effect.\n\nI have been forgetful about energizing pool lately. Apologize for that, I&#039;ll try better, like setting up different ringtones. \n\nThis Wednesday (America)/ Thursday (Eurasia), we will be moving our Guild Raid to  \nOrbit of the Forgotton (Combat Lv.80) (60 minutes) - Celestial Observatory\n\n(Wednesday) PST 7am, CST 9am, EST 10am, (Thursday) UTC 2pm, AWST 10pm\n\nWithin these three days, please let me know if any of you still wish to stay at Lv 70 Raid. There will be another announcement after the final raid of Lv 70.\n\nLast week Contributors:  \nWrenidall, Minutiae, Prosektikos, Snuggles, ShadowVoid, Przebiegly, p00pspanker, Radiumgirl, zerokai, Emmibaby\n\nAnd those who deposit to the stockpile:  \nG333",
